#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""mem0ctl — BORG shared local memory (mem0 OSS 2.x, fully local).

Models: qwen3.8:27b-mlx primary, llama3.1:8b automatic fallback.
Embeddings: nomic-embed-text (768 dims). Store: embedded Qdrant on disk +
SQLite history, both under ``BORG_HOME/mem0/data``.
Extraction model calls default to 127.0.0.1:11434; embeddings default to the
dedicated 127.0.0.1:11439 endpoint. Telemetry is force-disabled.

``MEM0_OLLAMA_URL`` controls extraction. ``MEM0_EMBED_OLLAMA_URL`` controls
embeddings without changing the extraction route.

This is a recall layer. It is never the authority — file corpora and
ledgers stay the source of truth. No client PII, no credentials.

Usage:
  mem0ctl add "text"    [--user OWNER] [--agent NAME] [--run ID]
                        [--model qwen|llama] [--raw]
  mem0ctl search "query" [--user OWNER] [--agent NAME] [--limit N] [--threshold F]
  mem0ctl list          [--user OWNER] [--agent NAME] [--limit N]
  mem0ctl delete MEMORY_ID
  mem0ctl stats
"""

